  "html": "<p>Whiskers are a race of evil rat-like monsters. They are probally the most common monster you will meet in the game and also the focus of many of the quests.  In Dew Valley are the weakest Whiskers, sometimes accompanied by <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Wolves\" title=\"Category:Wolves\">Wolves</a> and as you progress in the game more advanced types appear, they become stronger and acquire more powerful Elemental attacks.  Several <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Bosses\" title=\"Category:Bosses\">Bosses</a> of different dungeons are Whiskers.\n</p><p><font color=\"red\"><big>The Beginners Trail</big></font> now leads to <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Rattletooth Boss Guide</a>.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 6 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Rattle_Tooth's_Relatives\" title=\"Category:Rattle Tooth's Relatives\">Rattle Tooth's Relatives</a></li></ul><h3>W</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whisker\" title=\"Category:Whisker\">Whisker</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Category:Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademaster</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whisker_Seer\" title=\"Category:Whisker Seer\">Whisker Seer</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Category:Whisker Shaman\">Whisker Shaman</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Category:Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitter</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Whiskers\"</h2>\n<p>There are 86 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>1</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/100%_3vil\" title=\"100% 3vil\">100% 3vil</a></li></ul>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aged_Lorgalis\" title=\"Aged Lorgalis\">Aged Lorgalis</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sinistrad\"